<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear [<span style="background: yellow;">Prospective Host</span>],</font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Every year, thousands of people are
affected by sickle cell disease, and many of them rely on blood transfusions to
stay healthy. Did you know, 1 in 3 African American blood donors are a match
for people with sickle cell disease?<o:p></o:p></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p>

<p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">That's why we are reaching out to you
to ask if you would consider hosting a blood drive in support of sickle cell
patients. Your support would be greatly appreciated and could make a real
difference in the lives of those affected by sickle cell disease. <o:p></o:p></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">A</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">nswer the call to help </span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">ensure
that there is an adequate supply of healthy blood available for those who need
it most.</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Hosting a blood drive is easy, and w</span><span class="s2" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">e</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> would be honored to partner with you for this important
cause.&nbsp; </span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">We are</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> more than happy to answer any questions you
may have and provide you with all the support you need.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-themecolor:text1"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><i><span style="background: yellow;">&lt;&lt;PROMOTION&gt;&gt;</span></i></b><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><i> As a special thank you, every
time you host a Red Cross blood drive between July 1, 2023 and June 30, 2024
the donors that come to give blood, will </i></b><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><i>receive a $20 Amazon.com Gift
Card* by email, all courtesy of our partners at Amazon.**</i></b></p>

<p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">We thank you in advance and
acknowledging the important role you play in helping us meet the needs of
patients. We hope to hear from you soon to <span style="color: black;">schedule
your lifesaving blood drive.</span><o:p></o:p></font></p><p style=""></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-themecolor:text1"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely, <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="color: black; background: yellow;">&lt;AM Name&gt;</span></font></p><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:
Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1"></span></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">*Restrictions apply, see
amazon.com/gc-legal</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline;user-select: text;
-webkit-user-drag: none;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;overflow-wrap: break-word;
font-kerning: none"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">**Presenting
donors who receive this offer&nbsp;<u>and</u>&nbsp;present to donate during the
applicable promotional time frame are eligible to receive the&nbsp;above
described&nbsp;e-gift card(s). This offer is non-transferable and not
redeemable for cash. Limit one (1) per presenting donor unless otherwise&nbsp;indicated.
[If a presenting donor qualifies for multiple offers, the donor will receive
all offers unless otherwise indicated.] Instructions on how to&nbsp;redeem your
gift card will be emailed to the address listed in the presenting donor’s
American Red Cross donor profile approximately thirty (30) days after attempted
donation(s). All gift cards are subject to individual merchant terms and
conditions, and all trademarks are property of their respective owners.
Merchants and offers are subject to change.&nbsp; No substitutions by
presenting donors. American Red Cross is not responsible for lost, damaged,
corrupted or stolen gift cards and may replace any such cards at its sole
discretion. Any questions or problems in connection with redeeming gift cards
must be directed to the merchant.</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:8.0pt">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:9.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
